- [N1] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start process in Admin Office") -> action(n2,"check if process has started") -> action(n3,"verify completeness of invoices") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n6,"continue process") -> action(n8,"are invoices still marked uncompleted") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n10,"continue process") -> converge(c2) -> action(n7,"receive completed invoices") -> action(n11,"mark relevant box on invoice entry form") -> action(n12,"is process completed") -> action(n13,"end process") -> end(e1)